# Configs reference templates

## Template source

`tester-v1/configs/reference/` is canonical. The create-model-configs skill copies from here only; never from `qwen3.5-9b-q8/` or other live model dirs.

## What belongs in reference

- **In reference:** shared probe variants used by `model_calibration.py` and by manual runs via `--server` / `--client` (footprint, ctx-probe, hello-world-baseline, and any future global probes).
- **Not in reference:** model-specific experiments (for example `hello-world-bench` on one slug only). Do not add those to `reference/` unless the user intends global rollout.

Live model directories hold `model.yaml` and a scaffolded `bench/` variant (copied from `hello-world-baseline/` when using the create-model-configs skill). Optional extra experiment variant dirs may be added manually.

## Promoting and demoting variants

- **Promote to global:** add a variant under `reference/` with `server.yaml` and `client.yaml`. Calibration picks it up automatically once `model_calibration` is taught the variant name (today: the three built-in names). Do not copy YAML into live model dirs (see [configs-reference-sync.mdc](configs-reference-sync.mdc)).
- **Demote from global:** remove the variant from `reference/` only. Model-specific copies under a live slug may remain.

## Editing shared behavior

- **Default:** edit `reference/` for shared probe behavior. Live `model.yaml` files are unchanged.
- **Exception:** one-off tweaks on a single model stay in that model's own variant subdirectory and must not be copied into `reference/` unless the user promotes them.

When `reference/` changes, follow [configs-reference-sync.mdc](configs-reference-sync.mdc).

## Calibration and reference

`model_calibration.py` validates that `configs/reference/{variant}/` exists, then runs `single_test_runner.py` with `config_dir` at `configs/{model}/{variant}/` (ephemeral, for result layout) and `--server` / `--client` pointing at `configs/reference/{variant}/`. Model path comes from `configs/{model}/model.yaml`.

## Do not run on reference

Do not run `single_test_runner.py` or `model_calibration.py` with `config_dir` under `configs/reference/`.
